{"page":90,"width":1873,"height":2807,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"3.6 에시지 친달 시스템에서의 프로세스 간 가신","words":[{"text":"3.6","x":958,"y":164,"width":59,"height":25},{"text":"에시지","x":1035,"y":163,"width":71,"height":28},{"text":"친달","x":1118,"y":162,"width":48,"height":29},{"text":"시스템에서의","x":1176,"y":162,"width":147,"height":29},{"text":"프로세스","x":1334,"y":162,"width":100,"height":27},{"text":"간","x":1445,"y":162,"width":23,"height":28},{"text":"가신","x":1479,"y":162,"width":48,"height":29}]},{"text":"이 기법에서 통신 연길은 다음의 특성을 가진다.","words":[{"text":"이","x":319,"y":303,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"기법에서","x":364,"y":303,"width":127,"height":39},{"text":"통신","x":507,"y":302,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"연길은","x":587,"y":300,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"다음의","x":698,"y":301,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"특성을","x":809,"y":299,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"가진다.","x":925,"y":297,"width":109,"height":40}]},{"text":"143","words":[{"text":"143","x":1607,"y":157,"width":60,"height":30}]},{"text":"• 통신을 원하는 각 프로세스의 ,상들 사이에 연결이 자동으로 구축된다. 프로세스들은","words":[{"text":"•","x":338,"y":407,"width":15,"height":15},{"text":"통신을","x":379,"y":398,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"원하는","x":493,"y":397,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"각","x":604,"y":396,"width":32,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스의","x":649,"y":395,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":",상들","x":830,"y":395,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"사이에","x":911,"y":394,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"연결이","x":1029,"y":395,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"자동으로","x":1144,"y":396,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"구축된다.","x":1296,"y":397,"width":147,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스들은","x":1460,"y":396,"width":210,"height":39}]},{"text":"통신하기 위해 상대방의 신원(identity)만 알면 된다.","words":[{"text":"통신하기","x":379,"y":460,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"위해","x":526,"y":458,"width":62,"height":40},{"text":"상대방의","x":603,"y":458,"width":130,"height":40},{"text":"신원(identity)만","x":751,"y":459,"width":263,"height":45},{"text":"알면","x":1026,"y":459,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"된다.","x":1109,"y":460,"width":75,"height":39}]},{"text":"• 연결은 정확히 두 프로세스 사이에만 연관된다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":338,"y":544,"width":15,"height":15},{"text":"연결은","x":381,"y":534,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"정확히","x":494,"y":533,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":604,"y":535,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"프로세스","x":649,"y":533,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"사이에만","x":796,"y":534,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"연관된다.","x":946,"y":535,"width":142,"height":39}]},{"text":"• 통신하는 프로세스들의 각 쌍 사이에는 정확하게 하나의 연결이 존재해야 한다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":338,"y":619,"width":15,"height":15},{"text":"통신하는","x":379,"y":608,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스들의","x":525,"y":607,"width":199,"height":39},{"text":"각","x":740,"y":608,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"쌍","x":784,"y":609,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"사이에는","x":830,"y":609,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"정확하게","x":980,"y":610,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"하나의","x":1129,"y":612,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"연결이","x":1247,"y":612,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"존재해야","x":1360,"y":613,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":1513,"y":612,"width":78,"height":39}]},{"text":"이 기법은 주소 방식에서 대장정을 보인다. 즉, 송신자와 수신자 프로세스가 모두 통","words":[{"text":"이","x":381,"y":736,"width":28,"height":39},{"text":"기법은","x":427,"y":736,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"주소","x":538,"y":737,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"방식에서","x":618,"y":737,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"대장정을","x":769,"y":737,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"보인다.","x":914,"y":738,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"즉,","x":1038,"y":741,"width":43,"height":38},{"text":"송신자와","x":1094,"y":741,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"수신자","x":1246,"y":741,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1362,"y":742,"width":177,"height":39},{"text":"모두","x":1550,"y":742,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"통","x":1632,"y":741,"width":35,"height":37}]},{"text":"신하려면 상대방의 이름-을 제시해야 한다. 이 기법의 변형으로서 주소 지정 시에 비대칭,","words":[{"text":"신하려면","x":318,"y":800,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"상대방의","x":464,"y":800,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"이름-을","x":612,"y":800,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"제시해야","x":726,"y":800,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"한다.","x":875,"y":802,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":967,"y":802,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"기법의","x":1014,"y":802,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"변형으로서","x":1131,"y":805,"width":165,"height":38},{"text":"주소","x":1313,"y":806,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"지정","x":1398,"y":805,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"시에","x":1481,"y":805,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"비대칭,","x":1566,"y":804,"width":100,"height":38}]},{"text":"을 사용할 수도 있다. 송신자만 수신자 이름을 지명하며, 수신자는 송신자의 이름을 제시","words":[{"text":"을","x":316,"y":865,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"사용할","x":361,"y":865,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"수도","x":473,"y":865,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":555,"y":865,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"송신자만","x":642,"y":864,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"수신자","x":790,"y":866,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"이름을","x":906,"y":865,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"지명하며,","x":1020,"y":867,"width":145,"height":40},{"text":"수신자는","x":1178,"y":868,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"송신자의","x":1329,"y":868,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"이름을","x":1483,"y":868,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"제시","x":1598,"y":867,"width":65,"height":38}]},{"text":"할 필요가 없다. 이 기법에서 send()와 receive() 프리미티브들을 다음과 같이 정의","words":[{"text":"할","x":316,"y":929,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"필요가","x":365,"y":929,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"없다.","x":479,"y":928,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":569,"y":929,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"기법에서","x":617,"y":929,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"send()와","x":767,"y":931,"width":159,"height":38},{"text":"receive()","x":938,"y":934,"width":181,"height":33},{"text":"프리미티브들을","x":1140,"y":932,"width":242,"height":39},{"text":"다음과","x":1396,"y":932,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"같이","x":1515,"y":931,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"정의","x":1599,"y":930,"width":65,"height":39}]},{"text":"한다.","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":315,"y":993,"width":73,"height":38}]},{"text":"• send(P, message)—메시지를 프로세스 P에 전송한다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":337,"y":1102,"width":14,"height":15},{"text":"send(P,","x":378,"y":1093,"width":134,"height":35},{"text":"message)—메시지를","x":536,"y":1092,"width":345,"height":41},{"text":"프로세스","x":894,"y":1094,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"P에","x":1043,"y":1095,"width":53,"height":38},{"text":"전송한다.","x":1114,"y":1095,"width":142,"height":39}]},{"text":"• receive(id, message)—임의의 프로세스로부터 메시지를 수신한다. 변수 id는","words":[{"text":"•","x":338,"y":1179,"width":14,"height":15},{"text":"receive(id,","x":378,"y":1169,"width":216,"height":36},{"text":"message)—임의의","x":619,"y":1169,"width":309,"height":41},{"text":"프로세스로부터","x":945,"y":1170,"width":238,"height":41},{"text":"메시지를","x":1201,"y":1171,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"수신한다.","x":1351,"y":1169,"width":145,"height":41},{"text":"변수","x":1513,"y":1169,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"id는","x":1595,"y":1169,"width":76,"height":37}]},{"text":"통신을 발생시킨 프로세스의 이름으로 설정된다.","words":[{"text":"통신을","x":378,"y":1233,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"발생시킨","x":491,"y":1232,"width":133,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스의","x":637,"y":1234,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"이름으로","x":824,"y":1234,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"설정된다.","x":974,"y":1234,"width":146,"height":41}]},{"text":"이들 기법(대칭적 그리고 비대칭적) 모두 프로세스를 지정하는 방식 때문에 모듈성","words":[{"text":"이들","x":381,"y":1365,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"기법(대칭적","x":462,"y":1365,"width":175,"height":42},{"text":"그리고","x":656,"y":1366,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"비대칭적)","x":776,"y":1366,"width":148,"height":43},{"text":"모두","x":942,"y":1368,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스를","x":1027,"y":1368,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"지정하는","x":1216,"y":1368,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"방식","x":1366,"y":1369,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"때문에","x":1449,"y":1367,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"모듈성","x":1564,"y":1368,"width":101,"height":39}]},{"text":"을 제한한다는 것이 단점이다. 프로세스의 이름을 바꾸면 모든 다른 프로세스 지정 부분","words":[{"text":"을","x":318,"y":1431,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"제한한다는","x":365,"y":1431,"width":166,"height":39},{"text":"것이","x":545,"y":1431,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"단점이다.","x":624,"y":1431,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스의","x":784,"y":1432,"width":171,"height":39},{"text":"이름을","x":974,"y":1432,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"바꾸면","x":1091,"y":1433,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":1205,"y":1435,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":1288,"y":1434,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스","x":1367,"y":1434,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"지정","x":1517,"y":1433,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"부분","x":1597,"y":1434,"width":70,"height":38}]},{"text":"을 검사할 필요가 있을 수 있다. 옛 이름들에 대한 모든 참조를 반드시 찾아서 새로운 이","words":[{"text":"을","x":318,"y":1496,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"검사할","x":366,"y":1496,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"필요가","x":477,"y":1496,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"있을","x":591,"y":1497,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":668,"y":1498,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":719,"y":1497,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"옛","x":810,"y":1498,"width":32,"height":38},{"text":"이름들에","x":858,"y":1497,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"대한","x":1011,"y":1498,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":1091,"y":1500,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"참조를","x":1173,"y":1499,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"반드시","x":1286,"y":1499,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"찾아서","x":1400,"y":1499,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"새로운","x":1515,"y":1499,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1633,"y":1499,"width":29,"height":39}]},{"text":"름으로 변경해야 할 것이다. 일반적으로 이러한 하드 코#(hard-coding) 기법은, 이 상","words":[{"text":"름으로","x":319,"y":1563,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"변경해야","x":433,"y":1561,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"할","x":577,"y":1562,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":626,"y":1562,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"일반적으로","x