추상적으로","x":804,"y":1824,"width":174,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스들에","x":990,"y":1824,"width":200,"height":38},{"text":"의해","x":1206,"y":1824,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"메시지들이","x":1286,"y":1823,"width":169,"height":40},{"text":"넣어지고,","x":1473,"y":1824,"width":146,"height":39},{"text":"메","x":1633,"y":1825,"width":31,"height":38}]},{"text":"시지들이 제거될 수 있는 객체라고도 볼 수 있다. 각 메일박스는 고유의 id를 가진다. 예","words":[{"text":"시지들이","x":321,"y":1883,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"제거될","x":466,"y":1883,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":578,"y":1886,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":627,"y":1887,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"객체라고도","x":706,"y":1888,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"볼","x":890,"y":1888,"width":36,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":937,"y":1889,"width":36,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":988,"y":1888,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"각","x":1075,"y":1888,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"메일박스는","x":1122,"y":1888,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"고유의","x":1305,"y":1889,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"id를","x":1422,"y":1889,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"가진다.","x":1506,"y":1888,"width":111,"height":39},{"text":"예","x":1635,"y":1889,"width":30,"height":38}]},{"text":"를 들어 POSIX 메시지 큐는 메일박스를 식별하기 위하여 정수 값을 사우한다. 이 기법","words":[{"text":"를","x":326,"y":1949,"width":23,"height":35},{"text":"들어","x":367,"y":1946,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"POSIX","x":446,"y":1950,"width":111,"height":31},{"text":"메시지","x":573,"y":1949,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"큐는","x":686,"y":1953,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"메일박스를","x":770,"y":1952,"width":171,"height":39},{"text":"식별하기","x":955,"y":1952,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"위하여","x":1106,"y":1952,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"정수","x":1222,"y":1953,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"값을","x":1304,"y":1952,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"사우한다.","x":1386,"y":1953,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":1552,"y":1953,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"기법","x":1600,"y":1953,"width":64,"height":39}]},{"text":"에서 프로세스는 다수의 상이한 메일박스를 통해 다른 프로세스들과 통신할 수 있다. 두","words":[{"text":"에서","x":322,"y":2010,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스는","x":400,"y":2011,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"다수의","x":578,"y":2013,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"상이한","x":691,"y":2015,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"메일박스를","x":808,"y":2017,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"통해","x":991,"y":2016,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":1074,"y":2016,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스들과","x":1153,"y":2017,"width":210,"height":38},{"text":"통신할","x":1374,"y":2017,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1491,"y":2018,"width":36,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1543,"y":2018,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":1632,"y":2021,"width":37,"height":35}]},{"text":"프로세스들이 공유 메일박스를 가질 때만 이들 프로세스가 통신할 수 있다. send()와","words":[{"text":"프로세스들이","x":321,"y":2074,"width":195,"height":38},{"text":"공유","x":535,"y":2076,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"메일박스를","x":618,"y":2077,"width":169,"height":40},{"text":"가질","x":803,"y":2080,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"때만","x":887,"y":2080,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"이들","x":971,"y":2080,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1052,"y":2080,"width":174,"height":39},{"text":"통신할","x":1240,"y":2081,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1360,"y":2082,"width":37,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1415,"y":2081,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"send()와","x":1507,"y":2083,"width":164,"height":38}]},{"text":"receive() 프리미티브들은 다음과 같이 정의할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"receive()","x":320,"y":2142,"width":174,"height":33},{"text":"프리미티브들은","x":513,"y":2140,"width":236,"height":39},{"text":"다음과","x":761,"y":2144,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"같이","x":874,"y":2144,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"정의할","x":956,"y":2144,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1068,"y":2145,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":1117,"y":2144,"width":74,"height":40}]},{"text":"• send(A, message)—메시지를 메일박스A로 송신한다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":343,"y":2247,"width":14,"height":15},{"text":"send(A,","x":384,"y